WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:03.044
Why can't they live
as you do in this valley?

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:08.675
The ocean winds protect our valley.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:11.302
The Sea of Decay can't reach us here.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.388
What do you say, Yupa?

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:16.683
Isn't it time you settled in this valley?

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:19.602
Look at my condition.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.479
It would please everyone.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.190
Don't bother.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:29.446
Yupa's a man who is fated
to search forever.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.323
Fate, huh...

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:35.368
Obaba, what's he searching for?

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:39.622
Oh my, don't you know, Nausicaä?

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.834
Look, see the tapestry on the wall...

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.754
I can no longer see it.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:49.382
The figure in the left corner.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:54.763
"...clothed in blue robes,

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:58.099
descending onto a golden field,

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:02.729
to join bonds with the great Earth

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:07.358
and guide the people to the pure land,
at last."

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:12.322
Lord Yupa,
I always thought that was only a legend.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:15.158
You mustn't tease me, Obaba.

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.744
It's the same thing.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:22.749
I only wish to solve
the Sea of Decay's mysteries.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.419
Are we humans but a tribe
destined to be swallowed

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:29.506
and ruined by the Sea of Decay?

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.800
That is what I wish to know.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.192
If only I could help Lord Yupa...

